   "text": "Put servers AND keys on the same ring. A key belongs to the first server clockwise. Add or remove a server → only its neighbour’s keys move.",
   "originalText": "Put servers AND keys on the same ring. A key belongs to the first server clockwise. Add or remove a server → only its neighbour’s keys move.",
