   "text": "① The ring\nHash the server name AND the\nkey with the same function\nonto 0 … 2³²−1, bent into a\ncircle. Nothing is stored on\nthe ring — it is just\narithmetic.",
   "originalText": "① The ring\nHash the server name AND the\nkey with the same function\nonto 0 … 2³²−1, bent into a\ncircle. Nothing is stored on\nthe ring — it is just\narithmetic.",
