   "text": "② Modulo breaks\nhash % N depends on N. Change\nN and almost every key maps\nsomewhere else → every cache\nmisses at once, or terabytes\nmove between DB shards.",
   "originalText": "② Modulo breaks\nhash % N depends on N. Change\nN and almost every key maps\nsomewhere else → every cache\nmisses at once, or terabytes\nmove between DB shards.",
