   "text": "③ Only neighbours move\nA new server takes keys only\nfrom the server just clockwise\nof it. Removing one hands its\nkeys to its clockwise\nneighbour. Everyone else:\nuntouched.",
   "originalText": "③ Only neighbours move\nA new server takes keys only\nfrom the server just clockwise\nof it. Removing one hands its\nkeys to its clockwise\nneighbour. Everyone else:\nuntouched.",
