   "updated": 1792316706386,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "④ Virtual nodes\n3 real servers = 3 points →\nuneven gaps, uneven load. 150\npoints each → statistically\neven. A bigger machine simply\ntakes more points.",
